==Trivia==
* The True Triple Katana is often abbreviated as "TTK".
** The [[dictionary|abbreviation]] "TTK" sometimes cannot be said in Roblox chat depending on how it is used, mainly due to it also being an abbreviation for "Time To Kill". Instead, the player can use "True Trip" or "TT Katana" or other abbreviations.
* If the True Triple Katana's fourth M1 is used in the air, the user would then be able to travel greater distances than the [Z] move does.
* The True Triple Katana deals the third highest M1 damage out of every [[fighting style]] or [[sword]] in the game.
* If {{Ability|Z}} is used in a corner of a wall, the player has a chance to glitch through.
* {{Ability|X}}'s hitbox is much bigger than the projectile is visually.
* {{Ability|X}} can go through thin walls like the walls of the [[Mansion (Third Sea)]].
* The True Triple Katana can be obtained even without finishing the [[Colosseum Quest]], but it will be extremely difficult without the [[Manager]]'s help in finding the [[Legendary Sword Dealer]].
* The True Triple Katana can be obtained by not using the manager, this could be more efficient, but the rate the player will have to guess when the [[Legendary Sword Dealer]] is very low. But they can use this method since the Manager can sometimes get bugged.
* The True Triple Katana shares the same holding animation as The [[Triple Dark Blade]] and The [[Triple Katana]] due to all of them being three swords being held at the same time.
